is was fixed by dropping everything not in `ScanSpec.SCHEMA`.\r\n- Tests for legacy version are made, i used `generate_zea_dataset` for this, it might need to change if we choose to remove the function altogether\r\n\r\n- Cleanup of  vibecoding stuff\r\n- Remove some remaining mentions of `extent`, replace with `coordinates` (see #362)\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  - Added full backward compatibility for legacy HDF5 file formats with automatic version detection\n  - Issues informative warnings when loading older files\n\n* **Improvements**\n  - Enhanced GPU detection for JAX backend to prevent unnecessary CPU-only fallback\n\n* **Documentation**\n  - Updated spatial map specifications to describe per-pixel coordinate-based storage\n\n* **Tests**\n  - Expanded test suite for legacy file compatibility and version detection scenarios\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/tue-bmd/zea/pull/368?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","closed_at":"2026-05-25T21:27:50Z","comments":8,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tue-bmd/zea/issues/368/comments","created_at":"2026-05-20T14:24:44Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tue-bmd/zea/issues/368/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tue-bmd/zea/pull/368","id":4487299807,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"a3f880","default":false,"description":"Tests","id":8922573706,"name":"tests","node_id":"LA_kwDOO2AIwc8AAAACE9Orig","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tue-bmd/zea/labels/tests"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"514b58","default":false,